{"ID":"20240314091739-y7434zk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091739-y7434zk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091739-y7434zk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171430-sj885iz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171430-sldw0mk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:428,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171430-sldw0mk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:94,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:94\u0026#125;","title":"【温经汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171430-sj885iz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-sj885iz","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问曰：妇人年五十，所病下利，数十日不止，暮即发热，少腹里急，腹满，手掌烦热，唇口干燥，何也？师曰：此病属带下，何以故？曾经半产，瘀血在少腹不去。何以知之？其证唇口干燥，故知之。当温经汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-lg9tsw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-lg9tsw8","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"温经汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-43cvjl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-43cvjl0","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸三两、当归芎穷芍药人参桂枝阿胶丹皮生姜甘草各二两、半夏半升、麦门冬一升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-bc5f9s4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-bc5f9s4","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右十二味，以水一斗，煑取三升，分温二服，亦主妇人少腹寒，久不受胎；兼治崩中去血，或月水来过多，及至期不来。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-7vuwmey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-7vuwmey","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，接下来这个处方呢是中医里面很有名的一个处方，过去呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我用了很多这个处方专门帮太太呢助孕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个太太小姐到现在目前为止呢，经过我们中药去帮忙让她生小孩，生下来的小孩哦百分之百都是男的，无一例外。所以我每次跟病人讲，她来治 Infertility，就是不孕症，然后问她“太太请问你啊，你要男的女的？”“要先讲哦。”她说无所谓，好，你无所谓哦，吃了我的药你怀孕，保证你是男的。“那我想要女的呢？”找对人了，我可以帮你，对不对？你们有学过那个《黄帝内经》最后一段，这叫作"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大医的话一定要懂周易六壬"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，地理位置你可以帮她改，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以否则的话你用中药吃，吃中药得到助孕的千篇一律通通是男的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。然后特别跟她说，你放心，中药很公平，你金头发蓝眼睛吃下去绝对不会变成黄头发...我们吃这个中药不会变成中国人，还是跟你们很像，不会变成中国人你放心好了。那效果非常的好，这是第一个，我们会用到温经汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-kx2kpab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-kx2kpab","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"待会介绍温经汤的汤方的时候就会了解到，现在讲"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"什么时候要用温经汤？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个太太呢年五十，我们七七四十九，天癸要竭，应该女孩子要进入更年期，但是这个写更年期的时候你要记得哦，温经汤除了更年期很好用以外，没有更年期你也可以用哦，你不要说老师我就要等她 50 岁以后再用这个温经汤，你实在是哦，这个我不晓得怎么教你，哦，把你赶出门，嚯（笑）。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-iefksgt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-iefksgt","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个中年以后呢，病有下利啊，它说病人下利哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个下利是什么？不是拉肚子哦，这是下血不止，流血没有停止，更年期到了，结果还流血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，本来应该停啦，还是有月经，数十日不停止，一直不断地来。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"暮即发热"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，到了傍晚黄昏的时候就发热，这个黄昏是人间最美的时候，结果她在发热，“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"少腹里急，里急后重，腹满，手掌烦热，唇口干燥，何也？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”张仲景说，这个病呢属于带下的病，为什么？就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"过去这个太太小姐可能有流产过，或有淤血在少腹没有去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。为什么呢？这是唇口干燥，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"唇口干燥我们知道身体里面肯定有些淤血呆在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那我们要把它去掉的方，叫作温经汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么叫温经汤？就是说这个汤药药性很温，它能够调理月经，让月经变成正常"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以你如果遇到一个太太小姐，她月经不正常，常常有时候延后、常常提前或者怎么样，你可以用温经汤来做加减。但是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"温经汤要用的时候，一定是唇口干燥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹满，肚子胀满，月经不调都可以使用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-s8outjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-s8outjk","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以现在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方里面呢，最有名的调理月经的方子就是这个温经汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-0i90c0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-0i90c0g","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家来看这个温经汤。温经汤第一味药就是吴茱萸，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸呢入肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，在治症上面的时候是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝虚的时候用，肝虚的时候有几种状况，第一个头痛、呕吐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。老师啊，这个病人呢不管她月经来不来，只要头痛来的时候呕吐也吐翻了，就是吴茱萸汤，因为吴茱萸入肝。我们头部呢，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝脏直接进入百会然后再到眼睛里，所以眼珠子痛，眼珠子后边痛，旁边痛，都可以使用吴茱萸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝经是不是络到子宫，子脏，对不对？所以说我们会用吴茱萸来补他的虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归、川芎、芍药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个我们讲很多了，芍药能够止腹痛，这个处方里面呢，大家看哦，各二两，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加重吴茱萸以外，当归、川芎、芍药、人参、桂枝、阿胶、丹皮、生姜、甘草都是等量的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，原方是等量的，但是你一定要会做加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-wps0ae6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-wps0ae6","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如说现在这个太太来呢，她是人很虚，而且又是便秘，对不对？吴茱萸我们知道可以补肝家的阴，肝家的阴就是肝脏的血，阿胶我们可以加重，但是病人呢人很虚，那个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肚子又痛，里面有血结在胞门，芍药就可以加重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那她又有便秘，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"便秘的时候人那么虚，你再去用大黄芒硝人会很累，我们把当归加强，当归里面有油脂，会通利大便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以你如果不相信当归可以通利大便啊，你现在去买个 5 钱回来煮当归汤吃，吃完你就下利，因为里面油很多，那你如果吃了，说老师我没有下利，那是你那个当归不好，那个药房不晓得怎么保养当归哦。像我花了很多钱在保护药上面，你到我诊所以后你就会看到，一排冷冻箱，很多药都冷冻起来，所以我当归拿起来是油的。那外面很多药房台、北很多药房、大陆很多药房不知道当归要冷藏啊，拿起来干的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你这个当归没有油怎么叫当归呢？所以我的药有效，他的药没效"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我的药会稍微贵一点，因为我 maintain（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"保养"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）这个药花了很多钱在里面，同样是当归，到手上我就冷藏了。所以说这个药呢，当我们会用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝、人参、生姜、甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这都是行阳的药，所以补血，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阿胶能够止血，但是血很虚的时候，阿胶可以补血，同时呢可以利月经"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我过去呢我们用阿胶，病人没有月经的时候，三四个月没有来，可是她就是这个温经汤症，我们开阿胶下去，她吃完月经就来了，所以说人虚的时候，阿胶照样可以让月经来。只有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实证的时候要注意"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你看那女的体格很壮，那个泼妇骂街的那种人，对不对？那个阿胶一下去她月经没来，闷死她啊，害得她的胸部也涨了，因为奶水下不来啊，情绪又不好，本来是泼妇骂街，对不对？吃完以后她就发狂奔走，发狂奔走以后还得要把她送到台南那个叫什么...龙发堂对不对？送进去，这对付那种泼妇骂街是最好。那......这是阿胶的补血，所以虚实你要看清楚就好了哦。所以我们的黄连阿胶汤是补心血，所以我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用黄连跟黄芩作导药，能够把阿胶放到心脏里面去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"丹皮是活血化淤，子宫的活血化淤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-jiw1mkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-jiw1mkh","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那一般来说这温经汤呢我们会加一些...你看"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景在治妇科的时候，像半夏厚朴汤之类的方剂都会用到半夏，为什么？因为痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那女孩子呢想的比较多，比较忧郁，那我们都会用一些半夏把痰去掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麦门冬呢是润肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以这个药你开的时候，我们用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝生姜甘草把心脏的力量加强，同时把肺的津液补回去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，上源的时候啊，本来它是木，会燥热嘛，黄昏的时候它不是会发热吗？发热就是上焦肺里面没有津液了，心脏的火往上走，这个时候我们用这个麦门冬进去把肺的津液补足，补足的时候同时加强心脏的热，然后桂枝呢可以把心脏的热导到小肠里面去，这个时候再加些活血化瘀的药，再加些补血的药，这就是温经汤的来源。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171430-sldw0mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171430-sldw0mk","updated":"20240422171430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去呢，看这个后面：太太小姐“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"少腹寒，久不受胎；兼治崩中去血，或月水来过多，及至期不来。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”看这样子就知道，这个是一个非常好的调理女孩子月经的方剂。那你不要等到 50 岁后再用，这个不对的。"}]}]}